{#
  "Final hours" — the nominee broadcast.

  Rendered by NomineeBroadcastCommand, one pass per recipient. Twig, not a
  string-replace, so output autoescaping applies to every name that reaches it —
  a nominee called "Ade & Sons" must not break the markup it lands in.

  ── WHAT CHANGED FROM THE SUPPLIED DESIGN, AND WHY ─────────────────────────
  · The countdown was a `countdown_gif_url` placeholder for a hosted timer
    service. It now points at THIS platform's /email/countdown.gif, which draws
    the animation per request. See CountdownGif for why we do not use Sendtric.
  · "Share your voting link" pointed at the generic /vote. Every nominee has their
    OWN vote page, and telling somebody to rally supporters while handing them the
    all-nominees ballot is the ask undermining itself. It is now their page.
  · "Get them a seat" pointed at /tickets, which is not a route on this platform —
    it is /events. That link was a 404.
  · "View in browser" pointed at /email/view?id=…, which does not exist either.
    Removed rather than shipped dead.
  · Unsubscribe had nothing to point at. It is now a real one-click token link,
    and "Email preferences" is gone because there is no preferences screen to send
    anybody to.
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no, date=no, address=no, email=no, url=no">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>The Final Hours — Africa GATES</title>
<!--[if mso]>
<noscript>
<xml>
<o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
<o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
</o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
</xml>
</noscript>
<![endif]-->
<style>
  body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }
  img { -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; border: 0; height: auto; line-height: 100%; outline: none; text-decoration: none; display: block; }
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; background-color: #f2f2ef; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse !important; }
  a[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; }
  u + #body a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  #MessageViewBody a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  span.MsoHyperlink { color: inherit; mso-style-priority: 99; }
  [data-ogsc] .agw-bg { background-color: #ffffff !important; }
  [data-ogsc] .agw-text { color: #14171a !important; }

  @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    .agw-wrapper { width: 100% !important; }
    .agw-px { padding-left: 28px !important; padding-right: 28px !important; }
    .agw-headline { font-size: 26px !important; line-height: 32px !important; }
    .agw-btn-pad { padding-left: 28px !important; padding-right: 28px !important; }
    .agw-hero-pad { padding: 28px 20px !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body id="body" style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f2f2ef;">

<!-- PREHEADER -->
<div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#f2f2ef; opacity:0;">
  Voting closes soon. Rally your supporters and get them a seat — let's finish strong.
  &nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;
</div>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f2f2ef;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">


  <table role="presentation" class="agw-wrapper agw-bg" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:560px; max-width:560px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden;">

    <!-- DARK HEADER BAR (logo left, status badge right) -->
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color:#131a15;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td class="agw-px" style="padding:20px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td valign="middle" width="34" style="padding-right:10px;">
                          <img src="data:image/png;base64," width="34" height="34" alt="Africa GATES" style="display:block; border-radius:8px;">
                        </td>
                        <td valign="middle">
                          <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; line-height:16px;">Africa</p>
                          <p style="margin:1px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:2px; color:#4fbf7f; line-height:12px;">GATES</p>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="middle" align="right">
                    <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.6px; color:#8a9089; text-transform:uppercase;">Final Hours</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- HERO: live countdown GIF -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-hero-pad" align="center" style="background-color:#e9f2ec; padding:40px 20px;">
        <!-- Animated GIF, redrawn by the server on every open, so the time is true each
             time the message is looked at rather than true when it was sent. Frame 1 is a
             correct still for Outlook, which never advances past it. -->
        <img src="{{ countdown_url }}" width="320" alt="{{ countdown_alt }}" style="display:block; max-width:100%; height:auto;">
        <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#5b6b60;">Voting closes {{ closes_human }}</p>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- HEADLINE -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" align="center" style="padding:36px 40px 0 40px;">
        <h1 class="agw-headline agw-text" style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:28px; line-height:34px; color:#14171a; letter-spacing:-0.3px; text-align:center;">
          Finish <span style="color:#1f9d55;">strong</span>
        </h1>
        <p style="margin:10px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#71756c; text-align:center;">
          {% if first_name %}{{ first_name }}, you're{% else %}You're{% endif %} in the final stretch of Africa GATES voting{% if category_name %} in {{ category_name }}{% endif %}.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- WHY IT MATTERS -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" style="padding:32px 40px 0 40px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td style="border-left:2px solid #1f9d55; padding:2px 0 2px 16px;">
              <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:22px; color:#5b6b60; font-style:italic;">
                "The end of a matter is better than its beginning." — The Preacher
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <p style="margin:18px 0 12px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:23px; color:#43473f;">
          This is no longer just about how the journey began — it's about how we choose to finish it. You've come this far because your work, influence, and contribution to your community have been seen and recognised.
        </p>
        <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:23px; color:#43473f;">
          Now, help us make Africa GATES one of the most remarkable community experiences we've ever created.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- TWO ASKS -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" style="padding:34px 40px 0 40px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1.2px; color:#9a9c95; text-transform:uppercase;">
          Two things we're asking of you
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" style="padding:0 40px 0 40px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 0 22px 0;" valign="top">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="30" valign="top" style="padding:1px 14px 0 0;">
                    <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#1f9d55;">01</p>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 3px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14.5px; line-height:21px; color:#14171a; font-weight:700;">
                      Mobilise your supporters
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; line-height:21px; color:#5b6b60;">
                      Rally your fans, friends, family, colleagues and community to vote for you and help secure your place in this historic moment.
                    </p>
                    <a href="{{ vote_url }}" target="_blank" style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#1f9d55; text-decoration:none;">
                      Share your voting link &nbsp;&rarr;
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 0 4px 0;" valign="top">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="30" valign="top" style="padding:1px 14px 0 0;">
                    <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#1f9d55;">02</p>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 3px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14.5px; line-height:21px; color:#14171a; font-weight:700;">
                      Fill the room
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; line-height:21px; color:#5b6b60;">
                      Encourage your supporters to get their event tickets and physically join us — the people who believed in you should be there to celebrate with you.
                    </p>
                    <a href="{{ events_url }}" target="_blank" style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#1f9d55; text-decoration:none;">
                      Get event tickets &nbsp;&rarr;
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- DARK CALLOUT -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" style="padding:32px 40px 0 40px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#131a15; border-radius:14px;">
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:26px 28px;">
              <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14.5px; line-height:23px; color:#e9f2ec;">
                Every vote matters. Every supporter matters. Every ticket matters.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px agw-btn-pad" align="center" style="padding:32px 40px 0 40px;">
        <!--[if mso]>
        <v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="{{ vote_url }}" style="height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:300px;" arcsize="12%" strokecolor="#1f9d55" fillcolor="#1f9d55">
        <w:anchorlock/>
        <center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Vote &amp; Share Your Link</center>
        </v:roundrect>
        <![endif]-->
        <!--[if !mso]><!-->
        <a href="{{ vote_url }}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block; width:100%; max-width:300px; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#1f9d55; border-radius:8px; padding:15px 24px; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; text-align:center;">
          Vote &amp; Share Your Link
        </a>
        <!--<![endif]-->
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:14px 40px 0 40px;">
        <a href="{{ events_url }}" target="_blank" style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#43473f; text-decoration:underline;">
          Get event tickets
        </a>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- CLOSING -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" style="padding:38px 40px 0 40px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:22px; color:#5b6b60;">
          Let us not simply participate in Africa GATES. Let us make history together.
        </p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 2px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; color:#5b6b60;">With appreciation and anticipation,</p>
        <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13.5px; color:#14171a;">The Africa GATES Team</p>
      </td>
    </tr>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <tr>
      <td class="agw-px" align="center" style="padding:36px 40px 32px 40px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
          <tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #f0f0ec; font-size:0; line-height:0; padding-bottom:22px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
        </table>
        <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:1.2px; color:#1f9d55; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase;">Africa G.A.T.E.S.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#9a9c95;">
          {{ postal_address }}
        </p>
        <p style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; color:#9a9c95;">
          <a href="{{ site_url }}" style="color:#9a9c95; text-decoration:underline;">africagates.org</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:#9a9c95; text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>

  </table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
